{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2021-06-17 03:00:00', 'title': 'WABTEC REDUCES EMISSIONS AT PORT OF KIEL IN GERMANY WITH SHORE POWER SOLUTIONS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) AND THE PORT OF KIEL CELEBRATED THE INSTALLATION OF A SUSTAINABLE SHORE POWER SOLUTION TO SUPPORT CRUISE OPERATORS. SHORECONNECT HAS POTENTIAL TO REDUCE NEARLY ALL EMISSIONS FROM CRUISE SHIPS BY PROVIDING SHORE POWER, WHILE BERTHING AT THE PORT. “THE INSTALLATION OF OUR SHORECONNECT SOLUTION WILL ADVANCE THE PORT'S SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS,” SAID OLIVIER KOMPAORE, VICE PRESIDENT POWER COLLECTION FOR WABTEC. “A LARGE CRUISE SHIP TYPICALLY"}